### basic
# @name basic
GET {{base}}/b
Authorization: Basic user {{secret_secrets_basic_password}}

### bearer
# @name bearer
GET {{base}}/a
Authorization: Bearer {{secret_secrets_bearer_token}}

### form
# @name form
POST {{base}}/e
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

user=me&password={{secret_secrets_form_password}}

### headers
# @name headers
# [disabled] X-Old-Key: {{secret_secrets_header_x_old_key}}
GET {{base}}/c
Authorization: Bearer {{secret_secrets_header_authorization}}
X-Api-Key: {{secret_secrets_header_x_api_key}}
X-Trace: trace-1

### query
# @name query
GET {{base}}/d?api_key={{secret_secrets_query_api_key}}&page=1
